      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 18a4534a62688e84db4c361cdc7fab27, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 18
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 1
    m_MaxSize: 18
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<size=50>Intro</size>\r\n<size=10><i><color=grey>this is a subtitle meant
    to check if subtitles are compatible or not!</color></i></size>\r\n\r\nHello
    <color=blue>Fulbo-people!</color> We have been working <b>exhaustively</b> to
    bring you a whole new overhaul to the Fulbo Galaxy Experience! Our whole PvE
    system has been reworked and a whole new Shop integrated interface has been developed
    for your convenience. We\u2019ve also taken great steps towards mobile gaming
    core features, such as IAPs and additional currencies. The upgrade system for
    Players has been revamped, and we\u2019ve introduced a completely overhauled
    game economy.\r\n\r\n<size=30>Summary </size>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cup System for PvE</li>\r\n<li>Updated
    Difficulty</li>\r\n<li>Integrated Shop</li>\r\n- Upgrade System for Players\r\n-
    New Currencies\r\n- New Rewards\r\n- New Economy\r\n- Visual Overhaul\r\n- Cosas
    T\xE9cnicas\r\n- What 's Next?\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\nCup System for PvE\r\n\r\nOur
    good-old Story Mode has been overhauled into the brand new Cup Mode. In it, you\u2019ll
    be able to compete against the AI in an uphill ladder towards victory and glory!
    There are 10 unique cups, each with their own enemy teams that will stand in
    your way. Beat each of them, win the Final Match and claim the cup (as well as
    the rewards)! But beware, for you\u2019ll only have a limited set of lifes available,
    so do your best or risk losing it all. Each cup is harder than the one before,
    presenting ever-evolving challenges that will test your team and your capacity
    for adaptation. \r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s more, each cup has 3 sets of difficulty we
    call \u201Ctiers\u201D: each tier has more matches, bigger teams, longer games,
    harder challenges and sweeter rewards. Conquer the 10 cups in each of their 3
    tiers to claim the right to call yourself a true Fulbo Master!\r\n\r\n\r\nUpdated
    Difficulty\r\nYour favorite enemies are ready to rock-n-roll! We worked hard
    to bring them up to speed with your expertise, so be prepared to face a challenge!
    \r\n\r\nGoalkeeper\u2019s Fatigue\r\nGoalkeepers now get temporarily tired after
    each time they block a shot. Keep up the offensive and break through! \r\n\r\nDuels\r\nWe\u2019ve
    overhauled the way players interact with their enemies. Depending on the action
    they perform, the end result will favor overall whoever has the highest score
    in a certain stat. So you\u2019ll need to improve your players and team if you
    intend to go against the big guys! Nevertheless, there is still ample space for
    your skill to drive you far and beyond.\r\n\r\n\r\n\U0001F956 Integrated Shop\r\nWith
    the evolution of our in-game economy has come the necessary practicality of having
    everything in one place so that you may go merry-shopping to your heart\u2019s
    content! The Integrated Shop offers a unique interface with an horizontal slider
    with which you\u2019ll be able to swiftly surf through every purchase possibility
    within the game. We\u2019ve also added rewards for you to claim, so you may always
    receive a little something as a token of gratitude for loving our game!\r\n\r\n\r\n\U0001F199
    Upgrade System for Players\r\nOur player\u2019s career possibilities have been
    expanded! Now your favorite players can reach much higher stats should you invest
    enough time, effort and resources. Each player rarity has a certain innate threshold
    that will limit how far can they level up - once it\u2019s met, you\u2019ll need
    to \u201Cupgrade\u201D them into a higher \u201Ctier\u201D in order to continue
    progressing.\r\n\r\nSo now players may reach up to level 50!\r\nNew Currencies
    \r\nNow introducing 2 new currencies: Player Shards & Galaxiums!\r\n\r\nGalaxiums:
    they are used as our in-game hardcurrency, being directly purchasable with real
    money using IAPs. They are the key currency for premium content and the most
    valuable items within Fulbo Galaxy. But fear not! You\u2019ll be also able to
    acquire them through honest gameplay too!\r\n\r\nPlayer Shards: they are used
    for Upgrading your players to a higher tier, allowing more levels to be attained.\r\nNew
    Economy\r\nAll of the game\u2019s economy has been overhauled in order to properly
    balance all the new features we\u2019ve developed.\r\nNew Rewards\r\nIntroducing
    your new favorite reward: chests! Earn them by winning cups, or by IAPs.\r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s
    Next in Fulbo Galaxy\r\nPvP: Tournaments & Seasonal Ranking\r\nAchievement System\r\nGameplay
    Improvements\r\nCommunity Features\r\nFriend List\r\nPrivate Tournaments\r\nUser
    Profile & Collection"
